WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.340
Since Donald Trump's election, white,
Evangelical Christians have been a

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.240
critical part of his base. Evangelical
leaders are among the first to defend

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.900
him from criticism and forgive his
ethical lapses, but young, white,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.529
Evangelicals expressed far less
enthusiasm for Trump and his politics.

00:00:19.529 --> 00:00:23.400
There's a 30-point gap between younger
and older white evangelicals and views

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.420
of Trump, and here's why: first, for many
young, white, Evangelicals, the

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.289
immigration issue is complicated. Most say
immigrants contribute positively to

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:35.250
America's economy and culture. The
shifting cultural landscape, increasing

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.360
secularization, and a growing nonwhite
population, simply don't register among

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.750
young Evangelicals as a problem. In this
way their lives are dramatically

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.770
different from their parents. Numerically,
they are already in the minority, and

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.220
young adults today are more likely to
know an atheist than an Evangelical Christian.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.579
Despite this, Trump is still
poised to make off with the lion's share

00:00:53.579 --> 00:00:57.780
of votes among young, white, Evangelical
Christians, but he is likely redefining

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:01.710
the relationship they have with the GOP.
The implications that could have for our

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.860
politics, and Evangelical Christianity,
could be profound.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.320
How important do you think young, white, Evangelicals will be in the 2020 election? Let us know in our

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.040
poll. Also, let us know what other topics
you'd like our scholars to cover in 60

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:21.810
Seconds, and be sure to LIKE and
subscribe for more research and videos

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.100
from AEI.

